[1.131645, "o", "\r\n\r\n[part 2 of 3]  The recorded walkthrough, verbatim\r\n"]
[1.132086, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nThis is the whole record, verbatim -- every feature, every node, the\r\nfull menu tree, and what the grid's draw callback painted.\r\n\r\n"]
[1.139385, "o", "ZORK_WALKTHROUGH — corro 0.7.0 on the zork backend\r\n========================================================================\r\n\r\nWhat this records: the widget tree corro's GUI construction path built\r\nagainst the in-memory model, and what the grid's draw callback painted\r\nwhen it was run. Every line is a fact about this backend, read back\r\nout of the model while it was still live.\r\n\r\nHOW TO READ\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  [PASS]  the feature is present and reported with evidence\r\n  [MISS]  not present *in the tree as built*. Usually means the\r\n          widget is created on demand (a dialog, a picker), not\r\n          that the feature is missing. See ZORK_MISSING.md for the\r\n          features that are genuinely absent.\r\n  [N/A]   not a widget question (an app-state fact, reported anyway)\r\n\r\n1. THE BACKEND'S OUTPUT\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  corro 0.7.0 on the zork backend\r\n  ======================================================\r\n  \r\n  The widget tree above this text is corro's real GUI tree,\r\n  built against an in-memory model instead of a display.\r\n  \r\n  Widgets built: 98\r\n    2 xBoxWidget, 2 xCanvas, 1 xEntry, 4 xLabel, 20 xMenu, 1 xScrolledWindow, 67 xSimpleAction, 1 xWindow\r\n  Window title: \"corro 0.7.0\"\r\n  Cursor at rest: R999999999C702\r\n  Canvas draw: 2891 ops, 146 text runs\r\n    grid labels: [\"~1\", \"1\", \"2\", \"_1\", \"_2\", \"_3\", \"_4\", \"_5\"]\r\n  Menu items: 132\r\n  Model night mode: dark\r\n    You are in a dark room you cannot see. If a grue is here, it will surely eat you. Light the lantern with 'light' before you go further.\r\n  \r\n  Driving the model from the zork REPL. 'help' lists commands.\r\n  \r\n\r\n2. WINDOW AND TOP-LEVEL CHROME\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  [PASS] Window                 title=\"corro 0.7.0\"  size=Some(1200)xSome(800)  node 1\r\n  [PASS]   set_default_size     width=Some(1200) height=Some(800)\r\n  [PASS]   title set by app     \"corro 0.7.0\"\r\n\r\n3. MENU BAR AND ACTIONS\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  [PASS] MenuBar                1 MenuBar node(s)\r\n  [PASS] Menu / submenus        19 Menu node(s)\r\n  [PASS] SimpleAction           67 registered action(s)\r\n  [PASS] menu item model        132 item(s) across 20 menu(s)\r\n  Menu tree (6 top-level):\r\n    _File                    submenu\r\n      _New                     app.new_file\r\n      _Open file               app.open\r\n      S_ave as                 app.save_as\r\n      Expor_t                  submenu\r\n        _TSV                     app.export_tsv\r\n        _CSV                     app.export_csv\r\n        _ASCII table             app.export_ascii\r\n        Export a_ll              app.export_all\r\n        O_DS                     app.export_ods\r\n      _Width                   submenu\r\n        _Default width           app.set_max_col_width\r\n        _Column width            app.set_col_width\r\n      _Sort view               app.sort_view\r\n      _Persist sort            app.persist_sort\r\n      _Replay                  app.replay\r\n      E_xit                    app.quit\r\n    _Edit                    submenu\r\n      _Cut                     app.cut\r\n      _Copy                    app.copy\r\n      _Paste                   app.paste\r\n      Select _all              app.select_all\r\n      _Find                    app.find\r\n      _Replace                 app.replace\r\n      _Duplicate               app.duplicate\r\n      _Extrapolate             app.extrapolate\r\n      Edi_t in Text Editor     app.edit_external\r\n      _Workbook (External)     app.edit_workbook_external\r\n      F_ollow link             app.follow_hyperlink\r\n    _Insert                  submenu\r\n      _Rows                    app.insert_rows\r\n      _Mitosis (Row)           app.insert_mitosis_row\r\n      Mit_osis (Col)           app.insert_mitosis_col\r\n      _Cols                    app.insert_cols\r\n      _Special Char            app.insert_special_chars\r\n      A_ggregate               app.insert_aggregate\r\n      _Date            "]
[1.146532, "o", "        app.insert_date\r\n      _Time                    app.insert_time\r\n      _Hyperlink               app.insert_hyperlink\r\n    Fo_rmat                  submenu\r\n      _Scope                   submenu\r\n        _All                     app.format_apply_all\r\n        _Full col                app.format_apply_full_column\r\n        _Data                    app.format_apply_data\r\n        _Special                 app.format_apply_special\r\n        _Cell                    app.format_apply_cell\r\n        Se_lection               app.format_apply_selection\r\n      _Number                  submenu\r\n        _Decimal (generic)       app.format_decimal_generic\r\n        Currency (_$)            app.format_currency\r\n        _Rational                app.format_rational\r\n        Fixed _0                 app.format_fixed_0\r\n        Fixed _1                 app.format_fixed_1\r\n        Fixed _2                 app.format_fixed_2\r\n        Fixed _n                 app.format_fixed_custom\r\n      _Align                   submenu\r\n        _Left                    app.format_align_left\r\n        _Center                  app.format_align_center\r\n        _Right                   app.format_align_right\r\n        _Default                 app.format_align_default\r\n      _Reset                   app.format_reset\r\n      _Night mode              app.toggle_night_mode\r\n    _Sheet                   submenu\r\n      _Prev sheet              app.sheet_prev\r\n      _Next sheet              app.sheet_next\r\n      _New sheet               app.new_sheet\r\n      _Rename sheet            app.rename_sheet\r\n      _Copy sheet              app.copy_sheet\r\n      _Move sheet              app.move_sheet\r\n      _Go                      app.go_to_cell\r\n      _Balance books           app.balance_books\r\n      Free_ze                  submenu\r\n        _Col Lock                app.col_lock\r\n        _X-Lock                  app.row_lock\r\n    _Help                    submenu\r\n      _About                   app.about\r\n      _Row ops                 app.help_rows\r\n      _Col ops                 app.help_cols\r\n      Full _help               app.help_full\r\n  Distinct action names reachable: 68\r\n\r\n4. CANVAS AND THE DRAW CALLBACK\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  [PASS] Canvas                 node 8  size=Some(1)xSome(1)\r\n  [PASS]   draw callback        2891 ops recorded\r\n  [PASS]   text runs            146 text draw(s)\r\n  grid labels (first 12): [\"~1\", \"1\", \"2\", \"_1\", \"_2\", \"_3\", \"_4\", \"_5\", \"_6\", \"_7\", \"_8\", \"_9\"]\r\n  [PASS]   sheet chrome         margin/header labels present: true\r\n  [PASS]   redraws queued       3 on this canvas\r\n\r\n5. FORMULA BAR AND LABELS\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  [PASS] Entry (formula)        1 node(s)\r\n  [PASS] Label (chrome)         4 node(s)\r\n  [PASS]   fixed-width labels   92px (Some(\"A1\")), 220px (Some(\"\"))\r\n  [N/A]   formula buffer       \"\"\r\n\r\n6. SCROLLED VIEWPORT\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  [PASS] ScrolledWindow         node 9  hscroll=0.0 vscroll=0.0  size=NonexNone\r\n  [PASS]   scroll recorded      (0.0, 0.0)\r\n\r\n7. CONTAINERS AND TABS\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  [PASS] BoxWidget              2 node(s)\r\n  [MISS] Grid                   0 node(s)\r\n  [N/A]   sheets               1 (tab bar shows when >= 2)\r\n\r\n8. ON-DEMAND WIDGETS (built by the app when used; probed here)\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  Each row constructs the widget through the adapter and reports what\r\n  it holds. corro builds none of these at startup, so a count alone\r\n  would describe a schedule rather than a capability.\r\n\r\n  [PASS] Dialog                 constructs and holds state  — file open/save, special-char picker, aggregate picker\r\n  [PASS] DropDown               constructs and holds state  — aggregate picker\r\n  [PASS] CheckButton            constructs and holds state  — dialogs\r\n  [PASS] RadioButton            constructs and holds state  — dialogs\r"]
[1.148557, "o", "\n  [PASS] TextView               constructs and holds state  — log / revision panes\r\n  [PASS] Overlay                constructs and holds state  — context menus\r\n\r\n9. BACKEND MODEL STATE (the zork-specific layer)\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  [N/A] night mode             dark\r\n  [N/A] focused node           Some(6)\r\n  [N/A] current node           1\r\n  [N/A] running                true\r\n\r\n10. APP STATE THE GUI MIRRORS\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  [N/A] cursor                 R999999999C702\r\n  [N/A] editing                true\r\n  [N/A] status                 \"\"\r\n  [N/A] ops applied            0\r\n  [N/A] grid extent            2x2\r\n\r\n11. SUMMARY\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  Total nodes: 98\r\n    BoxWidget            2\r\n    Canvas               2\r\n    Entry                1\r\n    Label                4\r\n    Menu                 19\r\n    MenuBar              1\r\n    ScrolledWindow       1\r\n    SimpleAction         67\r\n    Window               1\r\n\r\n  Drive it: 'look' walks the tree, 'props' shows a widget's recorded\r\n  properties, 'select <n>' picks a menu item, 'help' lists the rest.\r\n\r\n\r\n[part 3 of 3]  The suite that asserts against it\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n32 tests, no X server, no OCR, no GTK. They re-ask the GUI feature\r\nquestions against the widget tree, and check the record above.\r\n\r\n"]
